Peer reviewed status and software access:
The software was submitted to CodeOcean, a computational reproducibility platform that conducts rigorous peer review of code and software prior to issuing a citable digital object identifier (DOI). The review process evaluates code functionality, documentation quality, reproducibility of results, and adherence to computational best practices. Following successful review, the software was accepted and published with the https://doi.org/10.24433/CO.8492516.v1 (see https://cutt.ly/2riYDEhH). 
